# Shared Packages

<!-- merged from: atlas/18-atlas-shared-packages -->

- Use shared packages before creating local equivalents.
- Preferred packages:
  - `@atlas/shared-types`
  - `@atlas/hooks`
  - `@atlas/api-client`
  - `@atlas/ui-components`
  - `@atlas/service-registry-client` — auth-proxy registration + retry / monitor for Next experiences
- Do not copy/paste common providers, shells, tables, badges, or API proxy helpers into experiences.
- Add new cross-experience capability to `packages/` instead of duplicating per app.
- Experience-specific code is allowed only for domain-specific behaviour.
- Use `workspace:*` dependencies for internal package references.
